  "limitations": [
    "Original RATIFY generators and predicate functions retained; explicit generator size5 is recorded, not the size-zero default.",
    "STS preserves initial delayed state and original input order; the ordinary node pulser priority policy is a separate caller concern.",
    "Four native STS samples and six accepted-property samples; no complete family or all-positive-outcome claim.",
    "All three nonempty STS signals begin delayed; these native samples cover state retention, expiry and the empty base case, not positive enactment or priority-order discrimination. Dedicated local regressions exercise those boundaries separately.",
    "DRep and SPO samples are all false; committee samples include both true and false. No all-branches approval coverage is claimed."
  ],
